# Claude Code 2.1.325, untrusted folder, mock Messages API: the folder
# trust screen shows; Down+Enter accepts it; the REPL boots and reports idle.
# Recapture needs an untrusted folder (fresh CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR, empty
# projects map) and the keyboard negotiation to finish before the keys.
wait-for 30000 trust this folder
# The CLI's keyboard-mode setup lands after the screen draws and resets the
# selection, so the keys wait it out.
wait 3500
key down
wait 500
key enter
wait-for 20000 effort
wait 500
